<div class="fv-review-format">
    <p class="fv-eyebrow">The review format</p>
    <h2>Four answers.<br>One useful next step.</h2>
    <ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>What can be confirmed</strong><p>Readable model, suffix and size markings, with the document used to check them.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Part or document candidates</strong><p>Relevant published references and the conditions that must match.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>What is still unknown</strong><p>Missing markings, uncertain fit or a component that needs a qualified test.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><strong>The next action</strong><p>What to photograph, ask a supplier, or confirm with the utility or installer.</p></div></li></ol>
    <p class="fv-review-foot">Manual reference review. Photos alone cannot establish internal failure, safe operation or local approval.</p>
</div>
